    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "three to four weeks is a bit sooner than we expected, but that's good news. once the L-Series student model hits that benchmark and passes the final validation, we're planning to spin down the main L-Series engine to free up those compute resources for the next project. \n\njust want to make sure the distillation quality is high enough so we dont run into issues during the transition. any concerns about the student's ability to handle the edge cases without the main engine's oversight?",
